# Dynamic element comparison keeps its subtype

Verifies a comparison against a dynamic element uses the stored subtype, so a
millimeter element compares against another millimeter magnitude correctly.

>>> source
let sizes: int[] = [10mm, 2cm]
let index = 0
print(sizes[index] > 5mm)
print(sizes[index] == 10mm)

<<< stdout
true
true

<<< stderr
